Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:36.41,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:42.76,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼着甜蜜杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:49.31,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}现在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:57.49,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我残躯化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:26.55,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}这簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:27.35,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:28.20,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.02,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.41,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.48,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:41.33,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.15,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:43.54,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
